{"lines": [{"text": "America spent almost four cents to make every single penny.", "start": 0.1, "end": 4.06, "spec": {"img": 1, "ov": "hook"}, "words": [["America", 0.08, 0.602], ["spent", 0.784, 1.045], ["almost", 1.102, 1.443], ["four", 1.443, 1.739], ["cents", 1.75, 2.091], ["to", 2.091, 2.182], ["make", 2.182, 2.523], ["every", 2.727, 2.989], ["single", 2.989, 3.273], ["penny", 3.284, 3.625]]}, {"text": "Metal, minting, shipping: three point six nine cents each.", "start": 4.26, "end": 8.508, "spec": {"img": 2, "ov": "cost"}, "words": [["Metal", 0.08, 0.432], ["minting", 0.67, 1.273], ["shipping", 1.5, 1.989], ["three", 2.239, 2.5], ["point", 2.5, 2.739], ["six", 2.739, 2.955], ["nine", 2.955, 3.216], ["cents", 3.216, 3.534], ["each", 3.545, 3.92]]}, {"text": "In 2024 alone, the Mint shipped over three billion.", "start": 8.708, "end": 12.476, "spec": {"img": 2, "ov": "count"}, "words": [["In 2024", 0.068, 0.83], ["alone", 0.83, 1.227], ["the", 1.568, 1.636], ["Mint", 1.636, 1.83], ["shipped", 1.83, 2.284], ["over", 2.386, 2.602], ["three", 2.602, 3.023], ["billion", 3.023, 3.443]]}, {"text": "That's an eighty-five million dollar loss. On a one-cent coin.", "start": 12.676, "end": 16.42, "spec": {"img": 3, "ov": "loss"}, "words": [["That's", 0.091, 0.227], ["an", 0.227, 0.375], ["eighty-five", 0.386, 1.034], ["million", 1.045, 1.386], ["dollar", 1.386, 1.625], ["loss", 1.636, 2.125], ["On", 2.489, 2.557], ["a", 2.557, 2.602], ["one-cent", 2.602, 3.068], ["coin", 3.08, 3.409]]}, {"text": "And it lost money for nineteen years in a row.", "start": 16.62, "end": 19.02, "spec": {"img": 3, "ov": "years"}, "words": [["And", 0.091, 0.136], ["it", 0.136, 0.216], ["lost", 0.216, 0.511], ["money", 0.523, 0.75], ["for", 0.761, 0.864], ["nineteen", 0.864, 1.33], ["years", 1.341, 1.625], ["in", 1.625, 1.682], ["a", 1.682, 1.716], ["row", 1.716, 2.08]]}, {"text": "So in November 2025, after two hundred thirty-two years, the U.S. stopped making them.", "start": 19.22, "end": 2